    {
      "id": "innkeeper",
      "kind": "npc",
      "display_name": "艾琳 · 旅店主人",
      "position_m": [5.2, 4.1],
      "visual": {
        "profile_id": "profile.npc.innkeeper",
        "base_asset_id": "asset.npc.innkeeper.base",
        "idle_manifest_asset_id": "asset.npc.innkeeper.idle_manifest",
        "ambient_action": "idle",
        "pivot_px": [520.0, 1500.0],
        "drawn_height_px": 1458.0,
        "portrait_region_px": [300.0, 40.0, 410.0, 455.0]
      },
      "ambient_lines": [
        "欢迎来到苍石庭院。我是艾琳，旅店就在身后。先在这里熟悉一下身手吧。",
        "旧木箱已经没人用了，打碎后留下的杂物可以收进背包。别对着镇民挥剑就好。",
        "庭院东边住着铁匠雷恩。如果找到了新装备，可以去和他聊聊。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "smith",
      "kind": "npc",
      "display_name": "雷恩 · 铁匠",
      "position_m": [18.5, 6.4],
      "visual": {
        "profile_id": "profile.npc.smith",
        "base_asset_id": "asset.npc.smith.base",
        "idle_manifest_asset_id": "asset.npc.smith.idle_manifest",
        "ambient_action": "idle",
        "pivot_px": [520.0, 1510.0],
        "drawn_height_px": 1500.0,
        "portrait_region_px": [300.0, 5.0, 410.0, 450.0]
      },
      "ambient_lines": [
        "我是雷恩。剑刃要锋利，握剑的手也要稳。欢迎来我的小作坊。",
        "庭院的宝箱里留了些武器与装备，靠近后交互就能打开。拿到手，记得检查背包。",
        "木箱能踩，也能打碎。喷泉池沿和中间的石柱都是实体，池水里不能落脚。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mira",
      "kind": "npc",
      "display_name": "米拉 · 药剂师",
      "position_m": [6.0, 5.1],
      "visual": {
        "profile_id": "profile.npc.mira",
        "base_asset_id": "asset.npc.mira.base",
        "idle_manifest_asset_id": "asset.npc.mira.idle_manifest",
        "ambient_action": "idle",
        "pivot_px": [510.0, 1520.0],
        "drawn_height_px": 1500.0,
        "portrait_region_px": [240.0, 20.0, 560.0, 650.0]
      },
      "ambient_lines": [
        "欢迎来到晨钟城，出发前来补充药剂吧。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oren",
      "kind": "npc",
